corr('P001412','equation(6) determinant exchange','Sum (-1)^(d-i) [y1,x2,...,xd] [y1,...,y_(i-1),x_i,y_(i+1),...,yd]','Sum_i [y_i,x2,...,xd] [y1,...,y_(i-1),x1,y_(i+1),...,yd]','The scan and authoritative transcription agree on the erroneous signs and indices. Expansion of x1 in the y basis proves the emended identity; a two-dimensional exact counterexample disproves the literal one.')
